@startuml
title US020 - As a user, I want to get a list (name and user) \n of the publicly published lists of a given genre
hidefootbox

'==== basic style ====
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Futura
skinparam objectFontSize 20
skinparam backgroundColor CornSilk
skinparam objectBackgroundColor WhiteSmoke
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam ArrowFontColor #3B4953
skinparam ActivationBackgroundColor black

autonumber
autoactivate off


actor User as U
participant "UI1:UI" as UI
participant "Ctl1:GetPublicListsByGenreController" as C
participant "_lopr:ListOfPublicationsRepo" as R

U -> UI: I want to get a list (name and user) of the \npublicly published lists of a given genre
UI --> U: What genre?

U -> UI: Genre
activate UI

UI -> C: getPublicListsByGenre(Genre)
activate C

C -> C: validateGenreNotNull()
C -> R: findPublicListsByGenre(Genre)
activate R

R -> R: filterPublicByGenre()\n(!isPrivate && genre matches)
R --> C: publicLists: List<ListOfPublications>
deactivate R

C --> UI: publicLists
deactivate C

UI --> U: Done!
deactivate UI

@enduml